<table class="infobox no-parenthesis-style infobox-npc"><tbody><tr><th colspan="20" class="infobox-header">Konar quo Maten</th></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-full-width-content"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/w/File:Konar_quo_Maten.png" class="mw-file-description"><img src="/images/thumb/Konar_quo_Maten.png/140px-Konar_quo_Maten.png?99856" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="140" height="323" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/images/thumb/Konar_quo_Maten.png/280px-Konar_quo_Maten.png?99856 2x" data-file-width="403" data-file-height="929" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr><tr><th colspan="8">Released</th><td colspan="12"><a href="/w/10_January" title="10 January">10 January</a> <a href="/w/2019" title="2019">2019</a> (<a href="/w/Update:The_Kebos_Lowlands" title="Update:The Kebos Lowlands">Update</a>)</td></tr><tr><th colspan="8"><a href="/w/Members" title="Members">Members</a></th><td colspan="12">Yes</td></tr><tr><th colspan="8"><a href="/w/Races" class="mw-redirect" title="Races">Race</a></th><td colspan="12"><a href="/w/Kahlith" title="Kahlith">Kahlith</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan="8"><a href="/w/Locations" title="Locations">Location</a></th><td colspan="12"><a href="/w/Mount_Karuulm" title="Mount Karuulm">Mount Karuulm</a></td></tr><tr class="leagues-global-flag"><th colspan="8"><a href="/w/Demonic_Pacts_League" title="Demonic Pacts League">League</a> region</th><td colspan="12"><span class="league-region" data-league-area="kourend"><span class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/w/Demonic_Pacts_League/Areas/Kourend" title="Kourend"><img alt="Kourend" src="/images/Kourend_Area_Badge.png?1f79a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="30" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="20" data-file-height="30" /></a></span> <span class="league-name"><a href="/w/Demonic_Pacts_League/Areas/Kourend" class="mw-redirect" title="Demonic Pacts League/Areas/Kourend">Kourend</a></span><span class="league-check">✓</span></span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="8"><a href="/w/Shop" title="Shop">Shop</a></th><td colspan="12"><a href="/w/Slayer_Equipment_(shop)" title="Slayer Equipment (shop)">Slayer Equipment</a>, <a href="/w/Slayer_Rewards" title="Slayer Rewards">Slayer Rewards</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan="8"><a href="/w/Gender" title="Gender">Gender</a></th><td colspan="12">Female</td></tr><tr><th colspan="8"><a href="/w/Choose_Option" title="Choose Option">Options</a></th><td colspan="12">Talk-to, Assignment, Trade, Rewards</td></tr><tr><th colspan="8"><a href="/w/Examine" title="Examine">Examine</a></th><td colspan="12">She looks dangerous, and slightly crazy!</td></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr><tr><th colspan="20" class="infobox-subheader">Map</th></tr><tr><td colspan="20" class="infobox-full-width-content infobox-image"><a class="mw-kartographer-map mw-kartographer-container center" style="width: 300px; height: 300px;background-image: url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-06-30_b/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_19_59.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-06-30_b/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_20_59.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-06-30_b/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_21_59.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-06-30_b/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_19_58.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-06-30_b/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_20_58.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-06-30_b/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_21_58.png); background-position: -222px -70px, 34px -70px, 290px -70px, -222px 186px, 34px 186px, 290px 186px; background-repeat: no-repeat;" data-mw-kartographer="" data-width="300" data-height="300" data-zoom="2" data-lat="3785" data-lon="1309" data-mapid="0" data-plane="0" data-overlays="[&quot;pins&quot;]"></a></td></tr><tr class="advanced-data"><th colspan="20" class="infobox-subheader">Advanced data</th></tr><tr class="advanced-data"><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr><tr class="advanced-data"><th colspan="8">NPC ID</th><td colspan="12">8623</td></tr><tr class="advanced-data"><th colspan="8">Link</th><td colspan="12"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://chisel.weirdgloop.org/moid/npc_id.html#8623">MOID</a></td></tr><tr class="advanced-data"><td colspan="20" class="infobox-padding"></td></tr></tbody></table>
<figure class="mw-default-size mw-halign-left" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/w/File:Konar_quo_Maten_chathead.png" class="mw-file-description"><img src="/images/Konar_quo_Maten_chathead.png?e0801" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="81" height="70" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="81" data-file-height="70" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<p><b>Konar quo Maten</b> (translated as <b>Konar the Hunter</b>) is a <a href="/w/Slayer_master" class="mw-redirect" title="Slayer master">Slayer master</a> who is found in the <a href="/w/Kahlith" title="Kahlith">Kahlith</a> settlement on the summit of <a href="/w/Mount_Karuulm" title="Mount Karuulm">Mount Karuulm</a>. Players must have a <a href="/w/Combat_level" title="Combat level">combat level</a> of at least 75 to be assigned a <a href="/w/Slayer_task" title="Slayer task">Slayer task</a> from her.
</p><p>Compared to other Slayer masters, Konar assigns <a href="/w/Wyrm" title="Wyrm">wyrms</a> and <a href="/w/Drake" title="Drake">drakes</a> more frequently and in higher amounts. Additionally, she is the only Slayer master who can assign <a href="/w/Hydra" title="Hydra">hydras</a> as a general task and the <a href="/w/Alchemical_Hydra" title="Alchemical Hydra">Alchemical Hydra</a> as a boss task.
</p><p>Blocking a task with Konar costs 80 <a href="/w/Slayer_reward_point" title="Slayer reward point">Slayer reward points</a>.
</p>
<div id="toc" class="toc" role="navigation" aria-labelledby="mw-toc-heading"><input type="checkbox" role="button" id="toctogglecheckbox" class="toctogglecheckbox" style="display:none" /><div class="toctitle" lang="en-GB" dir="ltr"><h2 id="mw-toc-heading">Contents</h2><span class="toctogglespan"><label class="toctogglelabel" for="toctogglecheckbox"></label></span></div>
