<div class="mw-references-wrap"><ol class="references" data-mw-group="n">
<li id="cite&#95;note-3"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-3">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text">The odds of getting a specific <a href="/w/Slayer_task" title="Slayer task">task</a> from the <a href="/w/Boss#Boss_slayer" title="Boss">boss</a> category is much smaller than getting a normal task, since there are two rolls for that task: one roll for the boss task, and one roll for the specific task within the boss category.</span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-ds2&#95;required-5"><span class="mw-cite-backlink">^ <sup><a href="#cite_ref-ds2_required_5-0">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href="#cite_ref-ds2_required_5-1">2.1</a></sup></span> <span class="reference-text">with completion of <a href="/w/Dragon_Slayer_II" title="Dragon Slayer II">Dragon Slayer II</a></span>
</li>
</ol></div>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Dialogue">Dialogue</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/Konar_quo_Maten?section=4&amp;veaction=edit" title="Edit section: Dialogue" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/w/Konar_quo_Maten?action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Dialogue"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
