<td class="center">This article on an NPC has an associated dialogue page.<br /><b><a href="/w/Transcript:Konar_quo_Maten" title="Transcript:Konar quo Maten">Click here</a></b> for a transcript of possible conversations with this NPC.<br /><b><a href="/w/RuneScape:Autolists/full#page=Konar+quo+Maten&amp;type=transcript" title="RuneScape:Autolists/full">Click here</a></b> for a list of other transcripts that this NPC speaks in.
</td></tr></tbody></table>
